      ],
      "review_state": "mechanically_checked",
      "slice_ids": [
        "slc_90ebcddf339c0f1e176d27f98742c7483bbf26a8c767fa965e3375d915b53e0a"
      ],
      "text": "The agent supports 20+ providers: native cloud integrations (e.g. Anthropic, OpenAI, Google Gemini, OpenRouter, Copilot, Mistral, Z.ai), seven documented local servers (Ollama, llama.cpp, llama-swap, LM Studio, LocalAI, MLX Server, vLLM), and any custom OpenAI-compatible endpoint."
    },
    {
